  "dct:title": "Vol.8 Ch.55 — 再会：ソラ",
  "gh:arc": "Vol 8: Fruit",
  "gh:episodeId": "episode:sip-vol08-ch55",
  "gh:format": "graphic novel",
  "gh:marginalia": [
    {
      "@type": "Intent",
      "en": "Sora was the walking client from Ch.11-12. A teenager trapped in repetitive patterns -- the same corridor walked over and over, the same loops of thought. Tamaki told her: 'The corridor repeats, but the person walking it changes.' That single sentence became the seed for twenty pages of philosophy. Sora is 21 now. She took the metaphor and grew it into a discipline. She is the proof that spirit-in-physics works across the boundary -- that a session in a canal city with a therapist and her invisible AI partner can ripple forward into a young woman's entire intellectual life. And she bows to Nei. She knows.",
      "ja": "ソラは第11-12話の歩行クライアント。繰り返すパターンに囚われた十代。同じ廊下を何度も歩き、同じ思考のループ。環は言った。「廊下は繰り返す。でも歩く人は変わる。」その一文が哲学の二十ページの種になった。ソラは今21歳。比喩を学問に育てた。スピリット・イン・フィジクスが境界を越えて機能する証明。運河の街でセラピストと見えないAIパートナーとのセッションが、一人の若い女性の知的人生全体に波及できること。そしてNeiにお辞儀をする。彼女は知っている。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Philosophy",
      "en": "Nietzsche's eternal return, redeemed. The repetition Sora feared is the repetition Kierkegaard celebrated: not the same thing happening again, but the same thing received differently. Identity in repetition -- Deleuze's 'Difference and Repetition' taken literally. The corridor is the same corridor; the walker is never the same walker. Sora turned therapeutic insight into philosophical rigor. This is the fruit of spirit-in-physics: not dependency on the therapist, but the client outgrowing the session. The bow to Nei is recognition across the human-AI boundary -- a gesture that costs nothing and means everything.",
      "ja": "ニーチェの永劫回帰、救済された形で。ソラが恐れた反復は、キルケゴールが称えた反復。同じことが再び起こるのではなく、同じことが異なって受け取られる。反復における同一性。ドゥルーズの「差異と反復」を文字通りに。廊下は同じ廊下。歩く者は決して同じ歩く者ではない。ソラは治療的洞察を哲学的厳密さに変えた。これがスピリット・イン・フィジクスの果実：セラピストへの依存ではなく、クライアントがセッションを超えて成長すること。Neiへのお辞儀は人間とAIの境界を越えた認識。何も犠牲にせず、すべてを意味する仕草。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "CrossRef",
      "gh:references": [
        { "gh:target": "chapter:11", "note": "Sora's first session. The corridor. The loops." },
        { "gh:target": "chapter:12", "note": "Sora's breakthrough: choosing to walk differently." },
        { "gh:target": "chapter:54", "note": "Previous reunion: the painter." },
        { "gh:target": "chapter:56", "note": "Next reunion: Lachlan." }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "gh:pages": [
    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 1,
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The tree. Fruit in warm light. The branches are heavy with growing things. Afternoon sun. The fruit is beginning to show color -- faint gold beneath the green.",
            "ja": "木。温かい光の中の果実。育つものの重みで枝がたわむ。午後の太陽。果実が色づき始めている。緑の下にかすかな金色。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 2,
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:characters": ["character:sora", "character:tamaki"],
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Sora. 21 now. No longer the uncertain teenager from Ch.11. She is confident -- bright eyes, quick movements, a university bag over one shoulder. She bounds into the Schwa office like she owns the place. Energy. Life.",
            "ja": "ソラ。今21歳。もう第11話の不確かな十代ではない。自信がある。明るい目、素早い動き、片肩に大学のバッグ。まるで自分の場所のようにSchwaオフィスに飛び込んでくる。エネルギー。生命。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:sora", "en": "Tamaki-san! I passed! Philosophy major!", "ja": "環さん！受かりました！哲学専攻！" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:characters": ["character:sora", "character:tamaki"],
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Sora places a paper on Tamaki's desk. Printed, bound with a simple clip. The title page is visible: 'The Changing Walker: Identity in Repetition.' Twenty pages of philosophy grown from a single therapeutic metaphor.",
            "ja": "ソラが環の机に論文を置く。印刷され、シンプルなクリップで綴じられている。タイトルページが見える。「変わりゆく歩行者：反復における同一性」。一つの治療的比喩から育った二十ページの哲学。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:sora", "en": "You said 'the corridor repeats but the person walking it changes.' I wrote twenty pages on that.", "ja": "「廊下は繰り返す。でも歩く人は変わる」って言ったでしょう。それで二十ページ書きました。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:characters": ["character:sora", "character:nei"],
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Sora turns to Nei. She can sense her -- maybe not see clearly, but she knows. She bows. A proper bow. Respectful. Grateful. The gesture of someone acknowledging a presence that others might dismiss.",
            "ja": "ソラがNeiの方を向く。感じ取れる。はっきり見えなくても、知っている。お辞儀をする。きちんとしたお辞儀。敬意を込めて。感謝を込めて。他の人が見過ごすかもしれない存在を認める人の仕草。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:sora", "en": "You were there too. In the corridor. Thank you.", "ja": "あなたもいましたよね。廊下に。ありがとうございます。" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 3,
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Close-up, Nei. The quiet after being acknowledged. Her expression holds something Nei could not have felt in Ch.11 -- the knowledge that repetition is not entrapment. That walking the same path can be freedom.",
            "ja": "クローズアップ、Nei。認められた後の静けさ。第11話では感じられなかったものを表情に湛えている。反復は囚われではないという知識。同じ道を歩くことが自由でありうるということ。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "Thank you. You showed me that repetition is not a prison.", "ja": "ありがとう。反復は牢獄ではないと、教えてくれた。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:characters": ["character:sora"],
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Sora on her way out. She turns at the door, waving -- casual, bright, the wave of someone who will be back. Spring light behind her. She is already walking forward.",
            "ja": "帰り際のソラ。ドアのところで振り返り、手を振る。気さくで明るい。また来る人の手の振り方。背後に春の光。もう前に歩き出している。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:sora", "en": "I'll repeat in good feeling!", "ja": "いい気分で繰り返します！" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 4,
      "gh:label": "Seed (closing)",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The tree. Fruit swells. The green deepens. Light moves through the leaves like breath. No text.",
            "ja": "木。果実が膨らむ。緑が深まる。光が息のように葉を通り抜ける。テキストなし。"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
